 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Nice. Do you want a weekend in nice hotel, with a couple of days of evening dinners and activities? Then it' cheaper and more relaxed. Have you thought about food? Would you cook a few things yourself, or order in? Not necessarily, but it' a friendly gesture. A big roast beef and roast vegetables is easy and feels special. That's a great help. Make the salad during the day so it's ready, and keep main course in oven while you set the table. Some will book a room at the guest house, some will sleep on sofas. It's flexible, and some people will be local.",
